WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.092
I can tell

00:00:00.904 --> 00:00:01.529
you wrote this

00:00:01.341 --> 00:00:02.095
yourself

00:00:02.622 --> 00:00:03.459
That's what an

00:00:03.318 --> 00:00:04.721
honours student's project

00:00:04.532 --> 00:00:05.947
supervisor said about

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:07.020
a ten-page midway

00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:08.188
progress report on

00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:09.461
controlling flapping-wing

00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:10.794
micro aerial vehicles

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:11.888
A compliment

00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:12.961
or an insult

00:00:13.486 --> 00:00:14.358
The student had

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.160
set the deadline

00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:15.797
a week early

00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:16.481
by accident

00:00:16.576 --> 00:00:17.813
then spent forty-eight

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:18.910
stressed hours writing

00:00:18.722 --> 00:00:19.995
five thousand words

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:21.894
references and diagrams

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:23.267
The takeaway

00:00:23.362 --> 00:00:24.328
write it yourself

00:00:24.222 --> 00:00:25.578
and treat everything

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:26.463
you consume like

00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:27.312
the school English

00:00:27.123 --> 00:00:28.444
lesson on spotting

00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:29.741
persuasive techniques

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.284
Full story on

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:31.991
the dashboard
